<body>
    <h1>Parent / Child firm configuration (Firm360)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-Context"><strong>Conte=
xt</strong></h3>
    <ul>
     <li>Parent firm is a logical entity, a grouping of child firms. Thus, =
parent firms do not have the industry unique firm data, e.g. broker code.</=
li>
     <li>Parent firms are set up in Firm360</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-Currentimplementation(=
asofPI-4,2023Q1)"><strong><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Current im=
plementation (as of PI-4, 2023 Q1)</span></strong></h3>
    <ul>
     <li>
      <h4 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-NBINissetupasadefaul=
tparentfirm(orgrandparentfirm)whichhasallNBINfirmsasitschildfirm-Thisstatem=
entisundertheassumptionthatNBFisNOTin-scope">NBIN is set up as a default pa=
rent firm (or grandparent firm) which has all NBIN firms as its child firm =
- This statement is under the assumption that NBF is NOT in-scope</h4></li>
     <li>
      <h4 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-Bydesign,usersassign=
edtoaparentfirmareabletobeassignedtoallorselectedRRcoderangesofalloranychil=
dfirms">By design, users assigned to a parent firm are able to be assigned =
to all or selected RR code ranges of all or any child firms</h4></li>
     <li>
      <h4 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-Currently,thereisnoa=
ssumptionorcascadingofresourceassignments/featurebundlesfromparentfirmtochi=
ldfirms">Currently, there is no assumption or cascading of resource assignm=
ents/feature bundles from parent firm to child firms</h4></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-NewParentFirmIdentifie=
r(asofOct2025)"><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: -0.003em;">New Parent Firm=
 Identifier (as of Oct 2025)</strong></h3>
