    <h4 id=3D"Parent/Childfirmconfiguration(Firm360)-NewField"><strong>New =
Field</strong></h4>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b00ce4f6-0955-4aeb-9afc-c587096e0e86">Once we've impl=
emented this change on Firm360 and you are ready to receive the new file, i=
t will include the same fields as before, along with a new 8-character fiel=
d, <strong>"<em>Parent_Code</em>"</strong>:</li>
    </ul>
